OL,3,CTV-related anniversaries for 28 JUL
OL,4,CEVENTS
OL,5,
OL,6,CG1989FNicholas Witchell presents the
OL,7,FSix o'clock News for the final time. He
OL,8,Fended the programme saying:
OL,9,
OL,10,F"And that's it from me. On Monday John
OL,11,FHumphrys takes over this chair. From
OL,12,FAndrew [Harvey] goodnight. From me, for
OL,13,Fnow, goodbye."
OL,14,
OL,15,FLater in the year, Nicholas joined BBC
OL,16,FBreakfast News as one of its main
OL,17,Fpresenters. From June 1990 until 2001,
OL,18,Fhe appeared as an occasional relief
OL,19,Fpresenter on other BBC TV news
OL,20,Fprogrammes.
OL,21,
OL,22,
OL,23,Sppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
